{"server":"cn","storyId":"act13d5_level_act13d5_st03","groupId":"act13d5","stageId":"act13d5_st03","title":"缄默启程","storyCode":"MN-ST-3","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act13d5/level_act13d5_st03.txt","sourceHash":"340adf5c134be11c3e88e188c45bfa36c869c090bcac0abb0b5df50342fcde42","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡西米尔 纯3"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_kxstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"是我。发言人的事情已经结束了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......白金大位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":".....您是谁？我联络的是董事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"无妨，该终端的授权码你应该已经收到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"既然知道这个频道，您也不是那两个青金大位，那么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"你心里有数就行，不需要这么谨慎试探。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来要说的是“无胄盟”之间的对话，和“董事们”没有关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"有一批征战骑士秘密越过了昏林边界，这件事绕过了商业联合会的眼，想必和耀骑士有关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"银枪的......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"青金大位将会全权负责此事，你无须过问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊，他们最近这么认真工作的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"你的任务是接替他们，监视耀骑士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"耀骑士吗......这也是个大麻烦啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"——所以其实那边的事态更麻烦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"还不清楚。一石激起千层浪，耀骑士的回归给我们带来了很多麻烦......而且，我们都太把注意力放在她身上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"还有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何，不要对耀骑士身边的萨卡兹出手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"关于那两位萨卡兹......您似乎知道很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"赦罪师和耀骑士，他们还同属于另一家“公司”。这件事会这么简单吗......我不确定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"做好你自己的事情，别像之前一样搞砸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"会忙起来的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......又是电话......是找恰尔内先生的吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"可是恰尔内先生......已经离开好久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"......喂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浑厚的男声","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"发言人吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不，抱歉，恰尔内先生现在——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浑厚的男声","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"我拨打的是发言人的号码，而你接起了电话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浑厚的男声","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你就是发言人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？什、什么？我不懂——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浑厚的男声","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"姓名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"我......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浑厚的男声","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"姓名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，请叫我马克维茨，我之前为斯沃玛食品公司服务，直到恰尔内先生邀请我合作......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浑厚的男声","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"先、先生？请问恰尔内先生他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豪迈的女声","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，马克维茨先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，抱歉女士，我以为——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豪迈的女声","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"我是斯沃玛食品公司董事长兼首席执行官，您应该听得出我的声音，发言人马克维茨先生，您被正式解雇了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豪迈的女声","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"从现在起，您既不属于斯沃玛食品公司，也不属于梅什科集团——请时刻记住，您代表商业联合会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豪迈的女声","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"等到赛事结束，您可以自由选择去留，根据您的表现，您会有丰厚的回报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豪迈的女声","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，您有三个待办事项，而且没有提问的权利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豪迈的女声","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"第一，保证赛事继续顺利进行，这是重中之重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豪迈的女声","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"第二，对耀骑士及相关事件进行舆论引导，我们不需要任何“止损”，我们要求的是在那之上的“收益”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豪迈的女声","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"第三，无胄盟的接洽人员三分钟后就会抵达你所处的地点，监督他们做好各自的事情，任何异样皆直接向商业联合会暨董事会议汇报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......！我并不想变成......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豪迈的女声","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"您还有什么要说的吗？发言人马克维茨先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我觉得......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我、我明白了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豪迈的女声","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，祝您一切顺利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......梦......这是梦吧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"事情我已经听说了......恰尔内的权限现在全部转移给你，是叫......发言人马克维茨，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来怎么做？或者你想冷静一下，给我放个假也行的喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我不懂......为什么是我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你也一样，白金大位，你为什么要被推上这个位置？我该怎么办......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"谁知道呢，也许他们只是想看着下一个人变得和他们一样糟糕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"在卡西米尔，别想太多就对了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"但......你看我......甚至买不起一套像样的西装，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"对了......恰尔内先生一定给你安排过任务，你应该知道无胄盟在做什么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道我在做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"那，那你在做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......一般来说就算我这么回答了也不会追问的吧......你啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，毕竟前段时间，我的确搞砸了一件事，现在我需要把精力放在上面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"五位骑士杀手在追踪目标的时候被发现，然后全部失踪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"无胄盟失、失踪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......你真的做好了知道详情的打算吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我别无选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"是么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"那就多留意一下“红松骑士团”，他们可不是单纯的竞技骑士这么简单，他们在公开和无胄盟......对抗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_storehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......耀骑士回来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰毫骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"街道上的人都在议论，她从天而降，拯救了玛莉娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"拯救？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰毫骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"骑士协会，不，也许是更上面的人，安排了玛莉娅的那场战斗。观众们都以为那只是刺激的表演，但明眼人都看得出来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰毫骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"那完全就是动真格的。耀骑士再迟一步，玛莉娅必死无疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......他们已经不打算遮掩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰毫骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"也许我们还是高估了他们的品性，这些事情每届特锦赛都在发生——他们毫不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"他们在乎不在乎根本不重要，我也没指望他们能通情达理，哪怕只是表面上做做功夫......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"重要的是，在卡西米尔谁都不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰毫骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"对外消息是，我俩因为训练意外暂停了所有活动......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......真糟糕啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰毫骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"“真糟糕啊。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......噗，哈哈哈哈，喂，怎么回事，这也太顺人意了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是他们暗地里动手而是利用了国民院，那才是穷途末路啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰毫骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"你啊......稍微轻松一点就会松懈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼......对方按捺不住性子先动手，结果反而方便了我们，当然高兴了呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"等到那两个家伙结束他们的工作，我们就该进入正题了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰毫骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么？还没在赛场上出够恶气？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰毫骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁......我越是和那些废物交手，我就越厌恶骑士贵族。让我最反感的是，曾经的我居然是他们的一员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，真复杂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰毫骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"他们的尊严和信仰一文不值，如今的骑士贵族似乎有些身价太低了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"别这么激动啊，每次一提这个话题你就来劲，安心啦，他们会吃到苦头的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"不过在那之前，我们还是把眼前的敌人摆正了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰毫骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"——无胄盟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会让他们暴露在光天化日之下的，对吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nearllivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，你有多久没有回家了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"你的房间还是老样子哦！我经常回去打扫......啊，虽然好像把桌椅都卖掉了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不过没关系！至少——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"玛莉娅，只要看到你们，就是回家的感觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"玛莉娅，你这身装备......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！是我擅自借了姐姐以前的装备......嘿嘿，怎么样，还挺合身的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，很合适，你真的长大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿......我也不比姐姐矮啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"你很努力了，真的。刚才在赛场里，没有机会好好地和你说话......我很想念你，妹妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......姐、姐姐，突然这样会有点让人害羞的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"但你一个人战斗到了现在，活了下来，坚持了下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"我也知道当初的决定会对叔叔和你造成多大的影响，但也从没想过你会——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"你有一定要去做的，无论遭遇什么苦难都不会退缩的事情，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"那姐姐就没有错！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......而且我其实从来做不到像姐姐那样，由内而外，都那么坚强......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"但是现在的我也开始明白了，至少，开始思考佐菲娅姑母一直说的那句话......思考骑士到底是什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我还没能像姐姐那样......但我走到今天这一步，靠的也是大家的帮助！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"如果非要说我能有什么信念的话，那也是姐姐启发我的！因为我也是临光家族的一员！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，但是姐姐你这次不能再像六年前那样离开了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"这次我会陪你一起，我们会无论最后会怎么样......我，相信姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"玛莉娅，你.......呵，你真的长大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......欸、欸，我、我突然开始说什么呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"总之赶快上楼去看看——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......玛嘉烈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"叔叔......这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"你安静。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"玛嘉烈......你回来做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"你知不知道自己出现在这里意味着什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"你救下了玛莉娅......但是，你为什么要回到卡西米尔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道父亲，你的爷爷为了把你“送出去”，付出了多大的代价吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"你竟然还敢冠冕堂皇地出现在这里......你以为协会和企业的眼睛没有盯着你吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......我会参加骑士竞技。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"我会取回应属于骑士的荣耀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"荣耀毫无意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"但其意义并不需要世俗的认可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"卡西米尔变了，他们变了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"——但我仍在，我们仍在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"不要得寸进尺......玛嘉烈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"本以为你离开卡西米尔后能稍微冷静一些......结果这就是你的答案吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"你这是在浪费我的时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"叔叔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"和你谈话的这段时间里，有无数的文书工作需要我处理，不要打扰我的工作......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"在事情变得麻烦之前，离开卡西米尔，既然你在别的地方能够活下去，就别回来这里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"叔叔！你怎么能这么说！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"玛莉娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"玛恩纳叔叔......我理解你的选择，我依然像过去那样尊敬你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"我也希望得到你的支持。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"——理解？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"你对我所见的我所做的都一无所知，却还是抱着你那不切实际的想法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾有幸瞥见了希望的一角，也亲历过战争的阴影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是选择继续笃信自己的信仰，并愿意为之而战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......卡西米尔不会因为耀骑士的付出和胜利而改变分毫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，我很清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"即使如此......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"即使如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......拔剑，玛嘉烈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"叔、叔叔！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你执迷不悟的话，只好让你从头学习何为“放弃”。倒在我的剑下，总好过倒在无胄盟的阴影里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"......如您所愿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞诺蜜","speakerId":"char_237_gravel","isRemote":false,"text":"那些竞技骑士就是一帮为了钱财甘愿受人摆布的废物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞诺蜜","speakerId":"char_237_gravel","isRemote":false,"text":"要是临光家的小女儿也出事的话，这征战骑士干脆也别叫骑士了，信不信我直接去掀了国民院的桌子！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞诺蜜","speakerId":"char_237_gravel","isRemote":false,"text":"——我们家老爷是这么说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......塞诺蜜啊，没必要学得这么惟妙惟肖吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞诺蜜","speakerId":"char_237_gravel","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，但是老爷特别强调要我原话转达。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你没必要事事都听你家老爷的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞诺蜜","speakerId":"char_237_gravel","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷还说了，如果大骑士长您不同意的话，他拄着拐杖也要去迎接耀骑士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞诺蜜","speakerId":"char_237_gravel","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷还说了，如果您叹了口气然后扶额头不想回答的话——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了......我知道他有多不高兴了，仗着点功勋每天都在监正院撒泼，还和以前一样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别忘了，他还是戴罪之身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞诺蜜","speakerId":"char_237_gravel","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，被商业联合会腐蚀渗透的国民院无权给老爷定罪。他们代表的早就不是国民和法律，只是他们自己，和背后的商人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......这也是他教你的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞诺蜜","speakerId":"char_237_gravel","isRemote":false,"text":"不，这是我自己想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就这件事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞诺蜜","speakerId":"char_237_gravel","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，还有件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞诺蜜","speakerId":"char_237_gravel","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛的人好像已经到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["玛嘉烈"]},{"speakerId":"char_204_platnm","aliases":["？？？","白金"]},{"speakerId":"char_237_gravel","aliases":["塞诺蜜"]}]}
